listing:   tshark on kbd.pcap (QEMU usb-kbd pcap property)
toolchain: TShark (Wireshark) 4.2.2 (Git v4.2.2 packaged as 4.2.2-1.1build3).
command:   tshark -r kbd.pcap -T fields -e frame.number -e usb.urb_type -e usb.transfer_type -e usb.endpoint_address -e usb.bmRequestType -e usb.setup.bRequest -e usb.bDescriptorType -e usb.setup.wIndex -e usb.setup.wLength -e usb.urb_len -e usb.urb_status | head -n 44; tshark -r kbd.pcap -V -Y 'frame.number == 18'
date:      2026-10-09T22:39:31Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 0
